      "block_preview_text": "Look at the octocopter at Rothamsted Research being used for surveillance, sowing seeds, and finding or herding farm animals. Watch the multi and hyperspectral cameras used to detect problems that the human eye can't see 24/7. Observe how vehicles and equipment in the farms of the future can use GPS and Wi-Fi to communicate with each other and weather/pest forecasts. Note that future farms might not all be on the ground but could be underground or integrated with local energies and opportunities",
